{"type":"text","timestamp":1794382745829,"sessionID":"ses_e3683fd44ffeu9mw9DmUwiGHZw","part":{"id":"prt_1c98bd0d8001M9nPwkqoSVXIcf","messageID":"msg_1c98bb3a5001hjizoULJJrKC0x","sessionID":"ses_e3683fd44ffeu9mw9DmUwiGHZw","type":"text","text":"<think>Now LinksTable (recent links) with paging and delete.\n\nOwnership helper: link.owner_id === user.id if owner_id is defined, else link.owner === user.username.\n\nLet me put that helper in api.ts? I'll add a small function in LinksTable and AdminPanel separately, or in types.ts. Let me add to api.ts:\n\n```ts\nexport function isOwnedBy(link: Link, user: User): boolean {\n  if (typeof link.owner_id === \"number\") return link.owner_id === user.id;\n  return link.owner === user.username;\n}\n```\nBut api.ts imports types; adding User to the import. Let me add it there.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794382745816,"end":1794382745827}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794382745853,"sessionID":"ses_e3683fd44ffeu9mw9DmUwiGHZw","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"call-cd19172f-cdc3-4d15-8881-059a3a7bf9fe","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/frontend/src/api.ts","newString":"import type { Link, LoginResponse, Page, User } from \"./types\";","oldString":"import type { Link, LoginResponse, Page, User } from \"./types\";\n","replaceAll":false},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /workspace/frontend/src/api.ts\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/frontend/src/api.ts\n+++ /workspace/frontend/src/api.ts\n@@ -1,6 +1,5 @@\n import type { Link, LoginResponse, Page, User } from \"./types\";\n-\n const TOKEN_KEY = \"shortener.token\";\n \n export class ApiError extends Error {\n   status: number;\n","filediff":{"file":"/workspace/frontend/src/api.ts","patch":"Index: /workspace/frontend/src/api.ts\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/frontend/src/api.ts\n+++ /workspace/frontend/src/api.ts\n@@ -1,6 +1,5 @@\n import type { Link, LoginResponse, Page, User } from \"./types\";\n-\n const TOKEN_KEY = \"shortener.token\";\n \n export class ApiError extends Error {\n   status: number;\n","additions":0,"deletions":1},"truncated":false},"title":"frontend/src/api.ts","time":{"start":1794382745824,"end":1794382745835}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c98bd0db001v8Ya69LbApsH8f","sessionID":"ses_e3683fd44ffeu9mw9DmUwiGHZw","messageID":"msg_1c98bb3a5001hjizoULJJrKC0x"}}
